#### Agents
<hr class="section-rule lvl-4">

An **agent** is the active layer: a channel plus an Elixir-flavored lifecycle (`start`/`cast`/`stop`), state, and a run-loop, built on the core actor/channel layer.  The self-contained demo below (`jqd.cmk`) assembles the actor transport, an agent (mailbox plus store), and a socketed leaf, then starts an agent, queries/transforms its state, casts events, and drains them to handlers.

